a portion of their annual cash retainers in the form of equity, as described above.  For each non-employee director who elected to receive equity in lieu of cash, such non-employee director received two awards under the Lakeland Industries, Inc. 2017 Equity Incentive Plan: (i) the first award, issued as restricted stock, which vests in full on the first anniversary of the date of </span></div></div></div>
  <div style="z-index:2;flex-direction:column;display:flex;padding-bottom:0.4in;min-height:0.65in;justify-content:flex-end;position:relative;box-sizing:border-box;"><p style="font-size:10pt;margin-top:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:center;margin-left:0;margin-right:0;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">15</span></p></div>
